    ct:description "(f) either Party will have the right to terminate this Agreement if no active RESEARCH PROJECTS exist for more than two (2) years, provided  that on or after the second anniversary of the expiration or termination of the last SCHEDULE to expire or terminate, the Parties have not agreed  on any new SCHEDULE despite (i) negotiations in good faith by both Parties or (ii) diligent, documented attempts by the terminating Party to  conduct negotiations in good faith with respect to one or more new SCHEDULES, to which attempts the other Party has not been responsive." ;
    ct:supported_by ex:C019P0209 ;
    meta:review_status "UNREVIEWED" .

